  "details": "I don't understand the point of being able to use an integer parameters in \"Parameter\" section of the receiver. The integer is set to 1 whenever the receiver gets triggered by a sender, but what if I want the integer to be set to a custom value? That would open up so many possibilities with Avatar Dynamics, but right now it's extremely limited.\nIt would also be nice to be able to stick to that custom value, even when the sender leaves the receiver area. This could be useful for stuff like clothing change, where we could just make a tablet with multiple buttons containing receivers.",
